                <mxCell id="branch_policy_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Branch &amp;amp; Enterprise Policy Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Centralized DHCP:&lt;/b&gt; Server 10.10.10.50 (HQ) serves HN/DN via &lt;i&gt;ip helper-address&lt;/i&gt; over IPsec.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;L2 Hardening:&lt;/b&gt; DHCP Snooping + DAI + Port Security active; unused switch ports → &lt;b&gt;VLAN 999 (shutdown)&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Future IoT Block (Da Nang):&lt;/b&gt; 10.30.64.0/18 (16,382 endpoints) | &lt;b&gt;Guest ACL (Hanoi):&lt;/b&gt; Blocks RFC1918, Internet only.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Netmiko IaC (SSHv2):&lt;/b&gt; Control Host 192.168.1.100 provisions VLAN 99 switches (.1.10, .2.10/11, .3.10)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#4e2600;" parent="1" vertex="1">
